<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on DTB Bund futures.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on DTB Bund futures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg said it had issued 140 million American-style call and put warrants, in 14 equal tranches, on DTB Bund futures.</p>
<p>There are six tranches on the December 1996 contract, four tranches on the June 1997 contract and four tranches on the March 1997 contract.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	  28.OCT.96   LISTING    FRFT, DUSS</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT   100	   ONE WARRANT CONTROLS 100 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  SCZA</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
